  <note opaque="false" posX="1632" posY="32" sizeHeight="97" sizeWidth="321" text="Extracting data from database &#13;&#10;and set the variables"/>
  <note opaque="false" posX="1120" posY="160" sizeHeight="64" sizeWidth="641" text="Downloading report  from OHCM, by using tSOAP control component &#13;&#10;this calls the SOAP API provided by deloitte team"/>
  <note opaque="false" posX="1120" posY="224" sizeHeight="97" sizeWidth="865" text="XML file contains the csv data but decoded file, then tjavarow converts Base64 into skv format, &#13;&#10;then we write the data into csv file"/>
  <note opaque="false" posX="1120" posY="320" sizeHeight="64" sizeWidth="513" text="Here we read the delimited file and set the variables"/>
  <note opaque="false" posX="768" posY="704" sizeHeight="64" sizeWidth="769" text="Setting up the last run time when this job was ran, Then closing the DB Connection"/>
  <note opaque="false" posX="1248" posY="448" sizeHeight="97" sizeWidth="417" text="For Every JOB Workflow will be same &#13;&#10;but the difference is Report File And RFC"/>
  <note opaque="false" posX="64" posY="832" sizeHeight="225" sizeWidth="865" text="Functional Architecture:&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;This is a Pay Role Data,  present it is migrating into OHCM and the pay role is on SAP ECC&#13;&#10;To make the pay role we need the employees data, and whatever activities are going on and we &#13;&#10;Require data in SAP ECC, but when the OHCM is up we would have the data in OHCM&#13;&#10;Finally to bring the data from OHCM to SAP ECC we use Talend in-between &#13;&#10;we will pull the data from OHCM then push the data into SAP ECC. This is the actual requirement.&#13;&#10;For this OHCM team has provides the SOAP API  and SAP team has provided RFC's "/>
